{"v":4,"desc":"這是一款超高難度的遊戲，你將使用筷子挑戰物理謎題。\n・玩家需使用筷子將食物從一個盤子夾到另一個盤子，來解開各種謎題。\n・筷子的動作是根據物理法則精確模擬的。\n・3秒法則：就算食物掉了，3秒內也依然OK。\n・目前尚無證據顯示，在遊戲中表現良好與現實中筷子操作技巧的提升有任何明確關聯。","publisher":"Achimphang Studio","release":"2026-12-03","genres":["模擬","其他","街機","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","葡萄牙文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.9GB / Switch 0.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/040a033a4b985cc9d106a0ae458d2d706ee373410390ce9ea9acdbdf016e4a66.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c8afc44a5f190123013a8c6d2fd74d2b8d4c6b25fbbd5cc263857764d2581162.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ffa6ec5841590511420de8568bfb0a80c367f1dbe70259a2a6f8492267de7592.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ad4da68cd10d17187efe6547882d98d06b3a1fbff1f2320cf31315c739e1de0c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/78ebfc88d6ef4bdb46af3ca44bc011e7beaf8ed18752a1d39194c5a77c2d7a39.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/121e5750815cb8a305aad649322edf6becdcd63d503e80179cba7b5b4bd404d5.jpg"],"titleId":"010058202a8e2000","dlc":[]}